    "Four lead centers were measured directly from the lower metal geometry in the source GLB.",
    "A1/A2 are internally common and B1/B2 are internally common; pressing the button connects the A and B sides.",
    "Verify source asset licensing before promotion to approved.",
    "Power: a tactile pushbutton has no required supply by itself; it switches a logic signal tied to VCC or GND through pull-up or pull-down wiring.",
